@page "/support"
@attribute [Authorize]
<PageTitle>Support | App Souls</PageTitle>
<div class="page-heading page-enter"><div><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER CARE</p><h1>Support</h1><p>Start a conversation or track a structured support ticket.</p></div></div>
<div class="workflow-details page-enter"><section class="panel workspace-form"><h2>Live chat <span class="notification-count" data-chat-unread="all" hidden></span></h2><p>Customers choose the Technical or Sales inquiry queue. Technical inquiries refer to purchased software; Sales inquiries can use the full active catalog.</p><a class="button primary" href="/support/chats">Open live chat</a></section><section class="panel workspace-form"><h2>Ticketing</h2><p>Submit a technical issue, bug, question or critical error with urgency, formatted details and scanned attachments.</p><a class="button primary" href="/support/tickets">Open tickets</a></section></div>
